.TH "MKVGAFONT" "1" "20 oktober 2001" "" ""
.SH NAME
mkvgafont \- produces fonts for X servers from a RAW-console font.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mkvgafont
.I raw-font
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.B mkvgafont
Creates fonts vga.bdf and vga.pcf.Z equivalent to the raw-font given
as parameter.  raw-font must be raw 8x16 font.  You can create such a
font by consolechars(8).
